  "solution": "Từ bảng xét dấu, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đổi dấu từ âm sang dương tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và từ dương sang âm tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, tức là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> có hai nghiệm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và hệ số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> âm.<br>Hàm số có dạng:\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSo sánh với các phương án, ta chọn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
